## Non free (LIST_32 & LIST_64):
p7zip-rar                                   # non-free rar module for p7zip
rar                                         # Archiver for .rar files
unrar                                       # Unarchiver for .rar files (non-free version)
)

## BIG GAMES
#Name                                         Beschreibung
